<title>POLAND: BRE APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 13.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>BRE APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 13.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 13.22 vs   11.13</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   14.76 vs   14.76</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 30.77 vs   25.18</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	55.35 vs   36.19</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 38.43 vs   45.58</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   52.10 vs   72.17</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		116.19 vs  102.16</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     207.79 vs  150.34</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Rozwoju Eksportu</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
